From 9364586fdc1f0b4c4ec51ebf0cec74e4e4511572 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 24bit192khz <118996408+24bit192kHz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 22:06:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] [local] mb/lenovo/sklkbl_thinkpad: dGPU support as
 flashed in C32

Power the dGPU in the bootblock, full reset when root port 1 is disabled,
power off before sleep, ACPI power resource from the SSDT. The same code as
the upstream series, but the switch is CMOS 0x6f == 0xd6 (`dgpu on`) because
this build has no option backend, and a power-button override clears it.
